# ...except the NDWH DWAPI upload workbooks.  Milestone #22 is scored off the
# newest one on the server, so NDWH's monthly re-issue has to be committable.
# These are negations of the *.xlsx rule above, so they must stay BELOW it.
!UJTP DWAPI UPLOADS*.xlsx
!AFGHS-Chak Daraja Dwapi Uploads*.xlsx

